FREAXPKG 1
@entry control 192 control
Package: hellofreax
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bufka2011
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: prints Hello, Freax!
 A tiny demo package for the Freax apt repository.
@entry d 0 /bin
@entry f 87 /bin/hellofreax.lua
-- hellofreax: demo program shipped by the hellofreax package.

print("Hello, Freax!")
@entry d 0 /usr
@entry d 0 /usr/man
@entry f 258 /usr/man/hellofreax
NAME
  hellofreax - print a friendly greeting

SYNOPSIS
  hellofreax

DESCRIPTION
  Prints "Hello, Freax!" to the terminal. Demo program shipped by the
  hellofreax package to exercise apt install, upgrade, and remove.

EXAMPLES
  hellofreax
    Says hello.
@end
